    {
      q: 'Can you handle multi-unit and townhouse developments?',
      a: 'Yes. We manage plumbing programmes for multi-lot residential estates, townhouse developments and apartment buildings. We can stage works across multiple lots simultaneously to keep the overall programme on track.',
    },
    {
      q: 'Do you offer fixed pricing for builders with ongoing work?',
      a: "Yes. Builders running consistent construction programmes can access fixed schedule-of-rates pricing. This simplifies your estimating, eliminates pricing surprises and lets you factor plumbing costs accurately into your client quotes.",
    },
    {
      q: 'What areas do you cover for new build plumbing?',
      a: 'We service new construction projects across Logan City, Brisbane (south), Redland City, Gold Coast (north) and Ipswich — more than 130 suburbs within 30 km of Loganholme.',
    },
  ]}
